    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Eli's Favorite Book Page\r\n\r\nIn this level, we're going to help Eli, who is struggling with his use of AI. Here is what he says:\r\n\r\n*\"The content is all there but the page looks so boring and plain. I wanted it to feel like the book - dark and mysterious with a bit of magic to it. It just looks like a default webpage right now.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Read Eli's `vision.md` file in the file explorer to understand what he asked for\r\n2) Decide how you want to fix it. You can update the `vision.md` file to be more specific and have AI Tutor regenerate the page, or go step-by-step with AI Tutor to fix the issues.\r\n\r\nKeep working with AI Tutor until you think the webpage addresses Eli's feedback. Once it does: press the Continue button!\r\n\r\n**Hint:** Think about what's missing from Eli's vision - he described the content well but left out details about how the page should look. What specific style properties could you add to capture \"dark and mysterious\"?",
